  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...8...10 spirit. For 30...198...240 seconds, enchantments and hexes cast by non-spirit creatures in range take twice as long to cast, and it costs twice as much Energy to maintain enchantments. This spirit dies after 30...198...240 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "創造一隻等級 1～10 的再生精靈。持續 30～240 秒，由非「靈」的生物施展的「加持」和「降咒」類型技能，施展時間增加為兩倍，而且維持「加持」類型的技能時所花費的能量也增加為兩倍。再生精靈在 30～240 秒後消失。"
    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Nature Ritual. Create a level 1...8...10 spirit. For 30...198...240 seconds, enchantments and hexes cast by non-spirit creatures in range take 50...70...75% longer to cast, and it costs twice as much Energy to maintain enchantments. This spirit dies after 30...198...240 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "召喚等級 1～10 的靈體，持續 30～240 秒。範圍內非靈體生物施放加持與降咒所需時間增加 50～75，維持加持的能量成本為兩倍。"
    }
  },
